<%--
Section_Columns - nested 2:1 column split inside a section (own collapse + gutter)

<Slot:primary> - the wider (2) column
<Slot:secondary> - the narrower (1) column

Splits content INSIDE a Section body into two columns; collapses to a single
stacked column on mobile. Not a card itself - it carries no chrome.

Usage:
    <Section $title="Overview">
        <Section_Columns>
            <Slot:primary> ...main facts... </Slot:primary>
            <Slot:secondary> ...aside... </Slot:secondary>
        </Section_Columns>
    </Section>
--%>
<Define:Section_Columns>
    <div class="Section_Columns__primary"><%= content('primary') %></div>
    <div class="Section_Columns__secondary"><%= content('secondary') %></div>
</Define:Section_Columns>
